{"version":1,"content":"<p>《愛．回家之開心速遞》的「大小姐」林淑敏與「送水輝」許家傑這對CP大受歡迎，兩人即將加盟《愛．回家之三代同糖》，日前林淑敏在社交網分享跟許家傑的合照，並配文：「用新的想像力出發吧！</p><p>」許家傑則留言：「呢鋪又有得玩喇！</p><p>」網民紛紛留言表示期待兩人</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.103637+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T07:01:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_hash":"47bf5a6f48780b96cd25b12b549a10397d04050139fcf7209f42cc107ccdc14c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}